new file mode 100644
index 0000000..88c027d
--- /dev/null
+++ b/qa/freetext_cases.gd
@@ -0,0 +1,31 @@
+extends RefCounted
+## Free-text phrasings a player might type, with the state they are typed in
+## and the canonical action expected. Used by qa/freetext_check.gd.
+## state: encounter / home / home_door (walkers at the door) / horde / outside / konbini
